# um-texts 1
=== QUESTITEM DoorKey00
Prison gates key
This key opens the prison gates.

=== QUESTITEM KKey01
Key to the mine gates
Opens the gates to the northern part of the mine.

=== QUESTITEM KKey02
Key to the mine
This key is needed to enter the eastern part of the mine.

=== QUESTITEM KKey03
Key to the ravine gate
With this key, you can enter the ravine in the southeastern area of the city.

=== QUESTITEM KKey04
Key to the secret cave gate
With this key you can open the entrance to a cave with an artifact.

=== QUESTITEM KKey05
The Gate Key
With this key you can open the gate to a cave with a portal.

=== QUESTITEM KKey06
Key to the neglected mines
With this key you can open the gates to the neglected mines.

=== QUESTITEM KKey07
Key
Such keys are used for levers in mines.

=== QUESTITEM Ogrestuff
Ogre's necklace
Probably the ogre has discovered the loss of his necklace by now... Will he figure out how he lost it?

=== QUESTITEM TeleportKey01
Portal Key
This key activates the Portal.

